<% layout("/layout/boilerplate") %>

<div class="outermostDiv">
  <div class="policy-container">
    <h1 class="policy-title">🔐 Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="policy-body">
      <p>
        At NaeVerse, we value your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we
        collect, use, and protect your information.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following information from users:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Username</li>
        <li>Password (stored securely in encrypted form)</li>
        <li>Bio</li>
        <li>Profile picture</li>
        <li>Uploaded images and videos</li>
        <li>Comments and likes</li>
        <li>Followers, following, friends, and activity data</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Create and manage your account</li>
        <li>Display your profile and posts</li>
        <li>Enable likes, comments, and follows</li>
        <li>Improve platform functionality</li>
        <li>Protect against abuse and unauthorized access</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Media &amp; Database Storage</h2>
      <p>
        Uploaded images and videos may be stored using Cloudinary. Application
        data is stored in MongoDB.
      </p>

      <h2>Password Security</h2>
      <p>
        Passwords are hashed before being stored and are not saved in plain
        text.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>Account Deletion</h2>
      <p>
        When you delete your account, your associated content and media may be
        permanently removed from our systems and media storage.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and Sessions</h2>
      <p>
        We may use cookies and session data to keep users logged in and maintain
        authentication.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable security measures to protect your information, but no
        system can be completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>NaeVerse is not intended for children under 13 years of age.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically. Continued use of the
        platform indicates acceptance of the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact the
        project owner.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
